WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.398 --> 00:00:03.581
Unit eighteen. Public Transport!

2
00:00:04.511 --> 00:00:12.777
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Elementary level!

3
00:00:12.827 --> 00:00:17.470
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.517
Today we learn: Public Transport. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.206 --> 00:00:26.990
Public transport. Say it with me. Public transport!

6
00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:34.421
Bus stop. Say it with me. Bus stop!

7
00:00:37.885 --> 00:00:42.285
Train station. Say it with me. Train station!

8
00:00:45.773 --> 00:00:49.189
Ticket. Say it with me. Ticket!

9
00:00:52.699 --> 00:00:56.782
Timetable. Say it with me. Timetable!

10
00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:03.894
Fare. Say it with me. Fare!

11
00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:11.420
Passenger. Say it with me. Passenger!

12
00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:18.405
Delay. Say it with me. Delay!

13
00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:32.660
Grammar time! Adverbs of frequency. Listen. I sometimes take the bus. I always check the timetable.

14
00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:39.800
Your turn. Say it with me. I sometimes take the bus. I always check the timetable.

15
00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:56.201
I take public transport to work every day. I wait at the bus stop and check the timetable. Sometimes there is a delay, so I buy my ticket early and pay the fare on time.

16
00:01:56.251 --> 00:01:57.717
I like this story!

17
00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:03.932
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:03.982 --> 00:02:05.249
Train station!

19
00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:11.505
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:11.555 --> 00:02:12.705
Passenger!

21
00:02:13.763 --> 00:02:23.436
Think and answer. Do you prefer public transport or driving? Why?

22
00:02:23.486 --> 00:02:24.741
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:28.080
This unit's value is Patience.

24
00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:30.522
I can show patience every day!

25
00:02:31.509 --> 00:02:35.915
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:35.965 --> 00:02:37.557
Goodbye, everyone!

